<section class="policy-hero"><div class="policy-wrap"><h1>Become a Sponsor</h1><p>Local businesses make it possible for Livermore kids to play rugby. Partner with the Lions and put your name behind the club.</p></div></section>

<section id="sponsors">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="section-body">Livermore Lions Rugby Club is a community-run youth club — every training session, piece of kit, and match day relies on support from people and businesses in Livermore. Sponsoring the club is a direct way to invest in local kids and get your business in front of the community.</p>
</div>
</section>

